  lupe: [['side:meridianstar', 'Somebody rings that bell every year on the anniversary. Hector says he has no idea who. Hector is a terrible liar.'], ['side:ledger5', 'Mama paid for that storage unit for thirty years so somebody would finally ask the right questions. You asked. I put her picture up by the register.']],
  hector: [['flag:msMeet', 'Wanda comes over for lunch on Saturdays now. We don\'t talk about the yard. We talk about woodpeckers. She says I\'m terrible at birds. She\'s right.'], ['flag:msLetter', 'She read it. She said that was all she could do, and she did it. Some days that\'s enough. Some days it isn\'t.']],
  wanda: [['side:meridianstar', 'I\'m up to two hundred and thirteen species now. I put you on the list as a joke. Then I took you off. Then I put you back on.']],
  pearl: [['side:drowned', 'Eli and I have found nineteen families now. Every Thursday he reads me the list, and I tell him who was sweet on who back in 1958. It\'s very important research.']],
  eli: [['side:drowned', 'Twenty-two things returned so far. We\'re still looking for the Batiste family Bible. Miss Pearl says there\'s a pressed rose in Psalms. We\'ll know it when we see it.']],
  felix: [['side:streetlight', 'I sign my real name now. Frank Moreno. It still looks strange on paper. But it looks right.']],
  nico: [['flag:slRespect', 'My dad says you asked him what he wanted. Thirty years, and nobody ever asked him that. He always tells that part first.'], ['side:streetlight', 'Dad drinks his espresso by the front window now. He used to sit in the back where nobody could see him.']],
  alvarez: [['side:streetlight', 'I teach a seminar at the academy now. One case, one page. Page 213. The cadets think it\'s about evidence. It\'s really about humility.']],
  greer: [['side:streetlight', 'I framed page 213 and hung it in my hallway. My husband thinks that\'s morbid. He\'s wrong. Again.']],
  hattie: [['main:4', 'Lassiter, Victor A. I spelled it right on the warrant and again on the judgment. Twice in one year. That\'s a personal best.'], ['flag:pikeDefend', 'Cadet Pike files his own reports now. No highlighter. I almost miss the highlighter.']],
  ramos: [['main:4', 'Lassiter asked me who booked him. I told him it was a cadet. He just said, "Of course." I don\'t know what he meant by that. I wrote it down anyway.']],
  ada: [['side:trail5', 'Eleven hundred and forty boxes, all checked in, shelved and indexed by a girl who did it for free on Thursday nights. I hired her. She starts Monday.'], ['side:streetlight', 'I keep a note on the Moreno box now that says "Page 213 restored." Every archivist after me will see it. In my line of work, that\'s how you apologize.']],
